{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Voogie's Angel","A hundred years after Earth is invaded by aliens, the last remnants of the human race dwell in underwater \"Aqua Bases.\" A team of five cybernetically enhanced women is trained for the purpose of carrying out guerilla attacks against the occupying forces. Earth's last hope for salvation is...Voogie's Angels.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["電脳戦隊ヴギィ'ズ★エンジェル",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-2453","ids":{"shikimori":2453,"mal":2453,"anilist":101178,"kodik":"serial-31320"},"kodikIds":["serial-21084","serial-31320"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-21084":"2020-01-12T15:30:12Z","serial-31320":"2021-01-04T20:18:11Z"},"title":"Ангелы Вуги","originalTitle":"Dennou Sentai Voogie's Angel","alt":"Voogie's Angel Voogie's Angel 電脳戦隊ヴギィ'ズ★エンジェル","description":"Спустя сто лет после того, как на Землю вторглись инопланетяне, последние остатки человеческой расы обитают на подводных \"Аквабазах\". Команда из пяти женщин, обладающих кибернетическими способностями, проходит подготовку с целью проведения партизанских нападений на оккупационные силы. Последняя надежда Земли на спасение - это... Ангелы Вуги.","year":1997,"type":"OVA","genres":["Драма","Фантастика","меха","военное"],"rating":5.71,"popularity":1585,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/2453/3844352a934523a54a89d6a8cfec2f44.jpeg","width":315,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/f22cd31b21f26931df4343474ea411230797b25a.jpg","width":768,"height":576}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-21084","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seri